WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:06.480
Jane Doe: Thanks for making time today. I would like to start with how you came to the project.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.900
Alex Sample: Sure. I joined in 2021, after the second round of
hiring, and I was on the data side at first.

3
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.200
Alex Sample: Then the team moved and I took over the survey work.

4
00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:18.700
Jane Doe: Did that change how you saw your role?

5
00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:21.000
Jane Doe: [inaudible]

6
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:27.300
Alex Sample: Yes. [laughter] Well, mostly. I stopped thinking of it as a side job and said so to my manager.

7
00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:28.400
Sam Rivera: Can I add something here?

8
00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:37.000
Alex Sample: Of course, go ahead.
